<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <!-- 目標框架：語法以 netstandard2.0 可用為準 -->
    <TargetFrameworks>netstandard2.0;netstandard2.1;net8.0;net9.0;net10.0</TargetFrameworks>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>

    <!-- 套件基本資訊 -->
    <PackageId>Ozakboy.Gmail</PackageId>
    <AssemblyName>Ozakboy.Gmail</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>Ozakboy.Gmail</RootNamespace>
    <Title>Ozakboy.Gmail — Thin async Gmail REST client + Google OAuth for .NET</Title>
    <Authors>ozakboy</Authors>
    <Company>ozakboy</Company>
    <Product>Ozakboy.Gmail</Product>
    <Copyright>Copyright © ozakboy 2026</Copyright>
    <Description>A thin, async-only client for the Gmail REST API and the Google OAuth 2.0 token endpoints, with no dependency on Google.Apis. List, read and send messages (via messages.send, so the single gmail.modify scope is enough), incremental sync with history.list, labels, trash, attachments, plus authorization URL building, code exchange, token refresh and revocation. You supply an access-token provider; the library never stores tokens. Every non-2xx response becomes a GmailApiException with the Google error reason and flags for expired history, revoked authorization and rate limiting; 429 / 5xx are retried with exponential backoff. No third-party MIME library: outgoing mail is composed by a built-in RFC 822 writer (GmailOutgoingMessage) or supplied as raw RFC 822 bytes. Targets netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0.</Description>
    <PackageTags>gmail;gmail-api;google;oauth;oauth2;google-oauth;email;mail;rest;async;rfc822;mime;history;labels;dotnet;csharp;netstandard</PackageTags>

    <!-- 版本資訊 -->
    <Version>2.0.0</Version>
    <PackageVersion>2.0.0</PackageVersion>
    <AssemblyVersion>2.0.0.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>2.0.0.0</FileVersion>

    <!-- 專案連結 -->
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/ozakboy.Gmail</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/ozakboy/ozakboy.Gmail</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>

    <!-- 授權與門面 -->
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageIcon>logo.png</PackageIcon>

    <!-- 建置產出 -->
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>

    <!-- 可重現建置與原始碼連結 -->
    <Deterministic>true</Deterministic>
    <ContinuousIntegrationBuild Condition="'$(GITHUB_ACTIONS)' == 'true'">true</ContinuousIntegrationBuild>
    <PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>

    <!-- 分析器與程式碼風格 -->
    <Features>strict</Features>
    <EnableNETAnalyzers>true</EnableNETAnalyzers>
    <AnalysisLevel>latest</AnalysisLevel>
    <EnforceCodeStyleInBuild>true</EnforceCodeStyleInBuild>

    <PackageReleaseNotes>
v2.0.0 — MimeKit is no longer a dependency. BREAKING: SendAsync now takes GmailOutgoingMessage instead of MimeKit.MimeMessage, and GetMessageRawAsync returns byte[] (the decoded RFC 822 message) instead of MimeMessage.

ADDED:
- GmailOutgoingMessage — a small outgoing-mail model (From, To, Cc, Bcc, ReplyTo, Subject, TextBody, HtmlBody, Attachments, InReplyTo, References, extra Headers) with ToRfc822Bytes(): a built-in RFC 822 / MIME writer (UTF-8, base64 bodies and attachments, RFC 2047 encoded headers, multipart/alternative + multipart/mixed).
- GmailAddress and GmailAttachmentContent (byte[] content) as the building blocks of GmailOutgoingMessage.
- SendRawAsync(byte[] rfc822, threadId) — send a message composed by any MIME library of your choice.
- GmailMessage.DecodeRaw() — the base64url-decoded RFC 822 bytes of a message fetched with GmailMessageFormat.Raw.

CHANGED (BREAKING):
- SendAsync(MimeMessage, threadId) → SendAsync(GmailOutgoingMessage, threadId). Build the message with GmailOutgoingMessage, or keep using MimeKit in your own project and call SendRawAsync with the serialised bytes.
- GetMessageRawAsync(id) now returns Task&lt;byte[]&gt; — parse with any MIME library, or read parsed parts through GetMessageAsync(id, GmailMessageFormat.Full) as before.
- The package no longer references MimeKit; remove any code that relied on it flowing in transitively.

Migration guide: https://github.com/ozakboy/ozakboy.Gmail/blob/main/docs/en/migration.md
Full changelog: https://github.com/ozakboy/ozakboy.Gmail/blob/main/docs/en/changelog.md
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <!-- 打包到 NuGet 的門面檔案（README 為英文版） -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\README.md" Pack="True" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\README_zh-TW.md" />
    <None Include="..\..\LICENSE" Pack="True" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="..\..\logo.png" Pack="True" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- NuGet 相依套件 -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Abstractions" Version="8.0.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Binder" Version="8.0.2" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- System.Text.Json 在 netstandard 不是內建，需套件；net8.0+ 走內建版本 -->
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.0' Or '$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.1'">
    <PackageReference Include="System.Text.Json" Version="8.0.5" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub" Version="10.0.300">
      <PrivateAssets>all</PrivateAssets>
      <IncludeAssets>runtime; build; native; contentfiles; analyzers; buildtransitive</IncludeAssets>
    </PackageReference>
  </ItemGroup>

  <!-- 測試專案需存取 Ozakboy.Gmail.Core 的內部型別 -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <AssemblyAttribute Include="System.Runtime.CompilerServices.InternalsVisibleToAttribute">
      <_Parameter1>Ozakboy.Gmail.Tests</_Parameter1>
    </AssemblyAttribute>
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
